creatures:
- name: Adult Green Dragon
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 19  
      **Hit Points** 207 (rollable(dice=18d12 + 90,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 40 ft., Fly 80 ft., Swim 40 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+11,label=+11,dicelabel=Initiative) (21)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=23)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=18)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=15)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=21)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=18)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Deception rollable(dice=1d20+9,label=+9,dicelabel=Deception Check), Perception rollable(dice=1d20+12,label=+12,dicelabel=Perception Check), Persuasion rollable(dice=1d20+9,label=+9,dicelabel=Persuasion Check), Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Damage Immunities** poison  
      **Condition Immunities** poisoned  
      **Senses** blindsight 60 ft., darkvision 120 ft., Passive Perception 22  
      **Languages** Common, Draconic  
      **Challenge** 15 (13,000 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +5  

      ## Traits

      ***Amphibious.*** The dragon can breathe air and water.

      ***Legendary Resistance (3/Day, or 4/Day in Lair).*** If the dragon fails a saving throw, it can choose to succeed instead.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The dragon makes three Rend attacks. It can replace one attack with a use of Spellcasting to cast [Mind Spike](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619038-mind-spike) (level 3 version).

      ***Rend.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+11,label=+11,dicelabel=To Hit [Rend]), reach 10 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d8+6,dicelabel=Damage [Rend]) Slashing damage plus rollable(dice=2d6,dicelabel=Damage [Rend]) Poison damage.

      ***Poison Breath (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 5-6,dicelabel=Recharge [Poison Breath])).*** *Constitution Saving Throw:* DC 18, each creature in a 60-foot ***Cone***. *Failure:* rollable(dice=16d6,dicelabel=Damage [Poison Breath]) Poison damage. *Success:* Half damage.

      ***Spellcasting.*** The dragon casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 17):

      At will: [Detect Magic](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619097-detect-magic), [Mind Spike](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619038-mind-spike) (level 3 version)  
      1/day: [Geas](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618940-geas)  

      ## Legendary Actions

      *Legendary Action Uses: 3 (4 in Lair). Immediately after another creature's turn, The Adult Green Dragon can expend a use to take one of the following actions. The Adult Green Dragon regains all expended uses at the start of each of its turns.*

      ***Mind Invasion.*** The dragon uses Spellcasting to cast [Mind Spike](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619038-mind-spike) (level 3 version).

      ***Noxious Miasma.*** *Constitution Saving Throw:* DC 17, each creature in a 20-foot-radius ***Sphere*** centered on a point the dragon can see within 90 feet. *Failure:* rollable(dice=2d6,dicelabel=Damage [Noxious Miasma]) Poison damage, and the target takes a -2 penalty to AC until the end of its next turn. *Failure or Success:* The dragon can't take this action again until the start of its next turn.

      ***Pounce.*** The dragon moves up to half its ***Speed***, and it makes one Rend attack.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Huge Dragon (Chromatic), Lawful Evil*  
    **Challenge** 15
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024adultgreendragon
  status: 1

